{"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [{"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "67b7fa73b6efc7269be2609b", "name": "Direction de la D\u00e9mocratie, des Citoyen.ne.s et des Territoires - Ville de Paris", "organization": {"acronym": null, "badges": [{"kind": "local-authority"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff89a3a7292c64a77eb7", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/e2/299b74ca0043a5b219f84e5c1ecdf5.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/e2/299b74ca0043a5b219f84e5c1ecdf5-100.png", "name": "Ville de Paris", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ville-de-paris", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ville-de-paris", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ville-de-paris/"}, "owner": null, "role": "creator"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "67b7fa73b6efc7269be2609a", "name": "Direction de la D\u00e9mocratie, des Citoyen.ne.s et des Territoires - Ville de Paris", "organization": {"acronym": null, "badges": [{"kind": "local-authority"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff89a3a7292c64a77eb7", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/e2/299b74ca0043a5b219f84e5c1ecdf5.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/e2/299b74ca0043a5b219f84e5c1ecdf5-100.png", "name": "Ville de Paris", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ville-de-paris", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ville-de-paris", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ville-de-paris/"}, "owner": null, "role": "publisher"}], "created_at": "2025-01-09T09:41:16+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "**Bureaux de vote 2025 : Localisation des bureaux de vote en vigueur.**\n\nLieu o\u00f9 les personnes inscrites sur les listes \u00e9lectorales se d\u00e9placent pour voter. Il y a 902 bureaux de vote en 2025.\n\nLes bureaux de vote sont le plus souvent localis\u00e9s dans les mairies d\u2019arrondissement, les \u00e9tablissements scolaires et les gymnases.\n\nLocalisation des bureaux de vote issus de SIEL (syst\u00e8me d\u2019information des \u00e9lections).\n\nLe bureau de vote est g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement situ\u00e9 dans le secteur du bureau de vote associ\u00e9. N\u00e9anmoins, il existe quelques cas de bureaux de vote situ\u00e9s dans un autre secteur.\n\nLa couche des bureaux de vote version 2025 est une actualisation de la couche des bureaux de vote version 2024.\n\nUn bureau de vote dit d\u00e9rogatoire a \u00e9t\u00e9 ajout\u00e9 auquel sont rattach\u00e9s les votes des d\u00e9tenus parisiens et des fran\u00e7ais de l'\u00e9tranger.", "description_short": null, "doi": null, "extras": {"dcat": {"license": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/Licence_Ouverte.pdf"], "rights": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/Licence_Ouverte.pdf"]}}, "featured": false, "frequency": "unknown", "frequency_date": null, "geopf": null, "harvest": {"backend": "DCAT", "dct_identifier": "https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/bureaux-de-vote-2025/", "domain": "opendata.paris.fr", "issued_at": "2025-01-09T09:41:16+00:00", "last_update": "2026-11-18T04:02:58.047000+00:00", "modified_at": "2025-01-09T09:41:16+00:00", "remote_id": "https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/bureaux-de-vote-2025/", "remote_url": "https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/bureaux-de-vote-2025/", "source_id": "5631ef2988ee3837ce531585", "source_url": "https://opendata.paris.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/exports/dcat/?include_exports=json%2Ccsv%2Cshp%2Cgeojson&lang=fr", "uri": "https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/bureaux-de-vote-2025/"}, "id": "6800b861799